{
  "slug": "dataslayer-marketing-skills",
  "name": "Dataslayer Marketing Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Marketing analysis suite with 7 skills and 4 parallel agents — audit paid campaigns, find SEO opportunities, detect churn signals, and generate branded PDF reports. Powered by a tested analysis engine (ds_utils.py, 113 functions). Works automatically with Dataslayer MCP or manually with CSV/JSON data.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **10 skills** and **4 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (10): `ds-audit` (Internal development tool that performs a comprehensive quality audit of all marketing skills and agents), `ds-brain` (Use this skill when the user wants a strategic, cross-functional analysis that connects paid, organic, content, and retention…), `ds-channel-report` (Use this skill when the user wants a quick, factual weekly or periodic overview of marketing metrics across…), `ds-churn-signals` (Use this skill when the user wants to identify accounts at risk of churning, understand why users are…), `ds-content-perf` (Use this skill when the user wants to understand how their blog or content is performing in terms…), `ds-eval` (Internal development tool that tests whether skill descriptions trigger correctly for different user inputs), `ds-lint` (Internal development tool that validates all SKILL.md and agent .md files against the Claude Code spec), `ds-paid-audit` (Use this skill when the user wants to audit, review, or diagnose their paid media campaigns), and 2 more\n- **Agents** (4): `ds-agent-content` (Subagent that extracts content performance data from GA4 and Search Console via Dataslayer MCP), `ds-agent-organic` (Subagent that extracts organic search data from Search Console and GA4 via Dataslayer MCP), `ds-agent-paid` (Subagent that extracts paid media data from Google Ads, Meta Ads, and LinkedIn Ads via Dataslayer MCP), `ds-agent-retention` (Subagent that extracts subscription health and retention data from Stripe (and optionally internal database) via Dataslayer MCP)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install dataslayer-marketing-skills@claude-community` from `Dataslayer-AI/Marketing-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 10,
    "agent": 4
  },
